---
import RuLayout from '../../../layouts/RuLayout.astro';
import gate from '../../../data/build-measured-value-gate.json';
const labels = ['Buyer-confirmed baseline зафиксирован для того же workflow definition и denominator','Есть evidence завершения delivery для согласованного workflow scope и deliverables','Определено post-delivery observation window с границами и достаточным data coverage','Observed comparison использует тот же workflow definition, denominator и measurement rules','Observed metrics получены из buyer-approved source evidence, а не synthetic inputs','Зафиксированы material changes workflow, volume, staffing, environment и process','Named buyer owner/reviewer принимает bounded measured-value statement и limitations','Любой customer-result или ROI statement имеет verified external provenance и explicit approval'];
---
<RuLayout title="BUILD Measured Value Readiness | BitEvo" description="Evidence-safe BUILD gate между delivery и measured-value/ROI claim. Synthetic value example не является customer evidence." enPath="/build/measured-value-gate" ruPath="/ru/build/measured-value-gate">
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">BUILD · MEASURED VALUE READINESS · PUBLIC TEMPLATE ONLY</div><h1 class="display">Delivery ещё не является measured value.</h1><p class="lede">BUILD Workflow Exception Diagnostic за USD 3,000 / пять рабочих дней может задать baseline и measurement method, но само завершение работы не доказывает observed customer value. Нужны external evidence того же workflow, denominator, observation window и buyer-approved sources.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container panel" role="note"><strong>NO CUSTOMER RESULT · NO ROI CLAIM · NO MEASURED VALUE CLAIM · SYNTHETIC EXAMPLE IS NOT CUSTOMER EVIDENCE</strong><p>Public template не представляет customer state. Existing workflow-value example — только synthetic arithmetic; он не доказывает delivery, observed value, savings, ROI, customer outcomes или renewal/expansion evidence.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Fixed BUILD offer</div><h2 class="section-title">One recurring exception workflow · USD 3,000 · пять рабочих дней.</h2><article class="panel"><p>Commercial scope остаётся фиксированным. Measurement evidence должно быть привязано к exact buyer-confirmed workflow и не может выводиться из public synthetic example.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Measurement evidence gate</div><h2 class="section-title">До measured-value statement нужны реальные доказательства восьми условий.</h2>{gate.required_measurement_evidence.map((item,index)=><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')} · {item.status}</div><h3>{labels[index]}</h3></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Current-state boundary</div><h2>Никакой delivery или measurement state здесь не представлен.</h2><p><strong>delivery_started=false · delivery_completed=false · measurement_window_closed=false · measured_value_observed=false · customer_case_evidence=false</strong>.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Synthetic boundary</div><h2>Synthetic arithmetic не заменяет measured value.</h2><p>Public workflow-value example показывает только calculation structure. Любой measured-value, customer-result или ROI statement требует real external evidence и explicit buyer acceptance.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/ru/build/paid-start-gate">Вернуться к paid-start gate</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/ru/build/workflow-value-example">Проверить synthetic value example</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/ru/build/renewal-expansion-gate">Проверить renewal / expansion readiness</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/build/measured-value-gate.json">Открыть machine-readable gate</a></div></section>
</RuLayout>
